  "editorialSummary": "Nothing captures our relentless march toward progress quite like the FAA unraveling an [entire air travel meltdown](https://www.abc.net.au/news/2026-11-16/trump-breaks-silence-after-airline-ground-stop/107388942) while Silicon Valley scrambles to clean up the [Nvidia spy scandal](https://oglobo.globo.com/economia/tecnologia/noticia/2026/11/15/apos-renunciar-ex-ceo-da-nvidia-discute-com-aliados-possivel-volta-ao-comando-da-empresa-diz-ghtml) and diplomats ponder [Ukraine ceding Donbas](https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cwvg2l312ylqo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss). At least researchers celebrating why the [heart never develops cancer](https://oglobo.globo.com/saude/noticia/2026/11/14/por-que-o-coracao-nunca-desenvolve-cancer-novo-estudo-explica.ghtml) can take comfort that our internal biology is managed far better than international borders.",
